{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Inventory velocity, turnover and restock planner"},"description":"Compute inventory velocity, turnover, reorder point, and exact suggested order quantity from stock and sales observations, enriched with live Bullion Price Check spot, melt, and lowest US dealer ask for tracked products (caller overrides optional). Separates unavailable sales from recorded zero sales. Each item's sales_observations shape is {status: 'recorded' or 'unavailable', entries: [{date, quantity}]} when status is recorded. Not a demand forecast. Standard tool free; for a version fine-tuned or customized to your business, email for pricing via https://bullionpricecheck.com/contact/.","inputSchema":{"$defs":{"decimal":{"maxLength":20,"pattern":"^(?:\\d+(?:\\.\\d*)?|\\.\\d+)$","type":"string"},"identifier":{"maxLength":64,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:-]{0,63}$","type":"string"}},"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"examples":[{"items":[{"on_hand":40,"on_order":0,"sales_observations":{"entries":[{"date":"2026-11-01","quantity":4},{"date":"2026-11-02","quantity":0}],"status":"recorded"},"sku":"american-silver-eagle-1oz"}]},{"items":[{"on_hand":25,"sales_observations":{"entries":[{"date":"2026-11-05","quantity":10}],"status":"recorded"},"sku":"american-silver-eagle-1oz"}]}],"properties":{"as_of":{"description":"Evaluation timestamp (ISO-8601). Defaults to live BPC refresh time.","format":"date-time","type":"string"},"items":{"description":"Stock rows (max 100). Each item is an object with sku (or product), on_hand, optional on_order, and sales_observations: {status: 'recorded' or 'unavailable', entries: [{date, quantity}]} when status is recorded. Do not send a bare array, a sales key, or a units field.","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"on_hand":{"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/decimal"},{"minimum":0,"type":"number"}]}